# Timeline: Changes

Spec: ChangesIndex
Purpose:
  Entry point for change records (@change.CH-XXX) tracking temporal
  evolution of architecture, decisions, skills, and policies.

Owns: timeline/changes/

Structure:
  Change records are .sdd files with @change.CH-XXX IDs.
  Each record includes: type, from, to, reason, decision, impact.

Rules:
  [CHANGE-01] Every change record MUST include a "why" attribution.
  [CHANGE-02] Changes WITHOUT a linked decision are flagged for review.
  [CHANGE-03] Changes are immutable once created.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  ChangeRecords: @../changes.sdd
  Snapshots: @../snapshots/INDEX.sdd
  Migrations: @../migrations.sdd
  Evolution: @../evolution.sdd

State: +
